# Pattern web pages

When adding or restyling a pattern page, follow `web/DESIGN.md` and reuse `web/styles.css`. Do not invent a new look.

Pattern pages are `web/BasicBlock-*.html` and `web/GarmentDesign-*.html`.

Keep: dark `#111` sheet, Poppins 400 uppercase with `0.08rem` tracking, no bold, 280px sidebar, Measurements / Derived / Display bands, text-only Reset (right-aligned) and Display toggles (grey off, white on, all off by default), dashed stitch + solid seam + grain line at `0.8px`.
